Z||000000||fierofreek2001||04-04-2001||05:52 PM||||hey guys, i was wandering if anyone has the same prob. as me...   after driving the fiero about 10-15 minutes, my car will start to make a pinging noise at low rpms when im going up a hill, or putting strain on the engine say like when im in 5th gear and put the pedal down hard, it will ping ping ping...    my dad helped me with the timing awhile back and that helped a lot, but i dont think it totally fixed it.. but isnt it supposed to be timed at 8 ? or 12? or something like that... its an 85 4 cyl engine... any thoughts on if its the timing or something else?<BR>thanks <BR>steve||||reg||1
